<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Citybus shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Citybus shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Citybus Group Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Shares of Citybus closed HK$0.225 or 7.32 percent higher at HK$3.30 on Thursday on volume of 49.02 million shares.</p>
<p>The company shares were listed on November 29, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
